Well, you definitely need a better cloak, but in my experience cloaks 
such as magic resistance are plentiful in slash'em, so it may not be 
worth wishing for one.  On the other hand, if you want to be safe from 
being drowned by eels and the like *and* have maximum magic 
cancellation, you might wish for an oilskin cloak (fireproof and with a 
small enchantment).  Then certain rings might come in handy.  Teleport 
control, for example, together with eating any leprechaun and nymph you 
manage to kill, can considerably improve your game.  Once you are low 
enough that summoners appear and you don't have a ring of conflict yet, 
you might wish for that one.
